# Machine 2: replaces a string of a and b with the number of b, a blank, and
# the number of a. It writes each count n as 1ⁿ, with 0 for zero, then stops
# with the head on the first symbol of the result:
#
#   abbabaabb  →  11111_1111
#   aa         →  0_11
#   bb         →  11_0
#
# The machine first sorts the input to bᵏaᵐ by moving each b that follows an a
# left to the start of the run of a. With the symbols in this order, it writes
# the result according to the counts k and m:
#
#   k > 0, m > 0   b → 1, the first a → _, the other a → 1, one more 1 at the
#                  end to keep m ones in the a block.
#   k > 0, m = 0   b → 1, then _ and 0.
#   k = 0, m > 0   a → 1, then 0 and _ to the left of the ones.
#   k = 0, m = 0   0, _, and 0.
#
# Sort:
# q0   reads the b at the start.
# q1   reads the run of a after the b.
# q2   carries a b left, to the start of the run of a.
# q3   writes the b on the first a of the run.
# q4   goes back to the start.
# Write the result:
# q5   selects one of the four cases.
# q6   changes b to 1, then replaces the first a with the separator.
# q7   changes a to 1 and adds one more 1 at the end.
# q8   writes 0 for the a.
# q9   changes a to 1 when there is no b.
# q10  goes back to the left of the ones.
# q11  skips the separator when the input is empty.
# q12  writes 0 for the b.
# q13  goes left over the count of a.
# q14  goes left over the count of b.
# q15  accepts, with the head on the first symbol of the result.

# Q
q0 q1 q2 q3 q4 q5 q6 q7 q8 q9 q10 q11 q12 q13 q14 q15
# Σ
a b
# Γ
a b 1 0 _
# q0
q0
# b
_
# F
q15
# number of tapes
1
# δ: from read to write move
q0 b q0 b R
q0 a q1 a R
q0 _ q4 _ L
q1 a q1 a R
q1 b q2 a L
q1 _ q4 _ L
q2 a q2 a L
q2 b q3 b R
q2 _ q3 _ R
q3 a q1 b R
q4 a q4 a L
q4 b q4 b L
q4 _ q5 _ R
q5 b q6 1 R
q5 a q9 1 R
q5 _ q11 0 R
q6 b q6 1 R
q6 a q7 _ R
q6 _ q8 _ R
q7 a q7 1 R
q7 _ q13 1 L
q8 _ q13 0 L
q9 a q9 1 R
q9 _ q10 _ L
q10 1 q10 1 L
q10 _ q12 _ L
q11 _ q8 _ R
q12 _ q15 0 S
q13 1 q13 1 L
q13 _ q14 _ L
q14 1 q14 1 L
q14 0 q14 0 L
q14 _ q15 _ R
